#
# The card art: one SVG per icon a card can show, named as the card data
# references it. The count is the number of icons the game has, and renaming
# one breaks the card that asks for it.
web/art/cards
web/art/cards/
#
# The status animations: one GIF per status effect the game applies. Same
# reason - the count is the number of effects, and the name is the reference.
web/demos/anim
web/demos/anim/
#
# The card preview and what renders it. render_card_preview.mjs writes
# card_preview.svg and card_preview.png whole on every run, with gen.log
# beside them and the game-icons it drew from, so the folder is one tool's
# output plus the tool. The SVG's length is the number of shapes in a card.
tools/card-preview
tools/card-preview/
